The sender of the other post to this issue has told me the solution. 
It appears to be a problem specific to the Alpha kernel only, Intel
does not have this problem.  Just disable tcp_ecn in
/proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_ecn .  This has fixed the problem for us.  Hope
this will help others.

--
Chris

