I am using a regular "null-modem" cable and minicom or kermit
for a terminal software if the other end is Linux.  Make sure
that your receiving program is configured not expect modem
controls (DCD mostly but maybe also RTS/CTS) or it will block
waiting for that modem to come on line.

Real serial terminals, if you have one around, work pretty well.

