'isomarkboot' from 'aboot' package.  Here is the top of a manual page:

NAME
       isomarkboot - Create bootable CD-ROMs for Linux/Alpha systems.

SYNOPSIS
       isomarkboot /dev/xxx path/to/bootlx [path/to/root.bin]

