Installing SRM is a little tricky, however.  You need to get both the
latest SRM and the latest AlphaBIOS.  Then take the SRM image and the
file fwupdate.exe from the AlphaBIOS disk and put them on a FAT
formatted floppy.  Put this in the drive and select firmware update
from the AlphaBIOS menus.

